    <briefdescription>
<para>Stream validator that enforces fail-closed chunk validation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Validates incoming audio chunks for:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Size bounds (MIN_CHUNK_SIZE_BYTES to MAX_CHUNK_SIZE_BYTES)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Format correctness (sample rate, channels, bit depth)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sequence ordering</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Stream lifetime limits</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Malformed data detection</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>All validation failures throw <ref refid="classthemis_1_1voice_1_1_stream_validation_error" kindref="compound">StreamValidationError</ref> and trigger fallback. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
